  "description": "DuckDB provider for ServiceStack.OrmLite - A fast, simple, and typed ORM for .NET. Enables high-performance analytical queries and data processing with DuckDB's columnar storage engine. NEW: BulkInsertWithDeduplication for massive datasets (845M+ rows)! Type-safe LINQ expressions, staging tables, BulkInsert (10-100x faster), multi-database, async/await. Community-maintained, not officially endorsed by ServiceStack.",
